# github.com/moby/moby — eir uses the Docker SDK as an API client only.
# None of the affected code paths (docker cp, image archive upload, plugin install) are reachable.

# High: Host file overwrite via race condition in docker cp mount setup
CVE-2026-42306

# High: Arbitrary code execution via PUT /containers/{id}/archive with malicious image
CVE-2026-41567

# Medium: DoS via race condition in docker cp mount setup (symlink swap)
CVE-2026-41568

# Medium: Privilege validation bypass during plugin installation
CVE-2026-33997
